# P3: ALL05 (Dark Night) WON with real orders only (no cheats). Generated by gen/mk_all05.py.
# Tanya (house 1, PlayerControl) and the three Spies (house 2) are the player's
# forces. The two Soviet nuclear silos (YellowTeam 6 / OrangeTeam 7) sit inside
# wall rings guarded by Tesla Coils; every base also has a Tesla Reactor
# (NANRCT, off the playable area) that only turns neutral ('No Power Plants')
# when the base has no Tesla Power Plant (NAPOWR) left.
#
#  1. The spies disguise as a Conscript. W7R1 (original walk speed, dogs with
#     DetectDisguise): Tanya holds (101,117) south of the red gate, out of the
#     y=110 coils' reach; spy 0 goes up to the gate as bait, the y=106 dog pair
#     runs out after it and Tanya shoots them; the next spy enters a RedTeam
#     power plant (blackout).
#  2. Tanya C4s the three RedTeam power plants during the blackout -> the red
#     reactor goes neutral and the red Tesla Coils stay dark for good; she hunts
#     the last plant-patrol dog and the last spy enters the Battle Lab
#     (secondary objective -> the map is enlarged, ResizeView).
#  3. 'Spies Dead 1' flies in three fresh spies. Yellow: no spy gets past the two
#     dogs by the plants, so Tanya clears the outer yellow dogs from spots out of
#     the coils' reach, then at full health walks the corridor to the silo's
#     south side (66,44) taking two coil bolts, C4s the silo, heals, walks out.
#     Orange (fv8b): Tanya clears the dogs from the strip south of the compound
#     and from (37,69) by the west gate, then from (29,57) on the west strip
#     (the spies' only Foot way since fv7c's per-tile Beach); the spies walk
#     down to her, one blacks out OrangeTeam and Tanya C4s the orange silo ->
#     'Victory 1' -> WON.
#
# Tanya's micro (act): shoot the nearest dog first, then the nearest enemy in
# range, else continue the order; never chase out of the leash. `repeat` keeps
# the script small (play_script.cpp expands it). W6 (R1): Tanya keeps that micro
# while the first spy walks to the red plant -- with the original threat radius
# (weapon range + 1, W6-02-11) she no longer stands safe; idle, she chased a
# passing Conscript north and the red dogs one-shot her (Tanya Dies -> LOST).
set render_every 3000
set on_quit continue
set campaign ALL05s.MAP GDI
until 60 scene == campaign-load
click start
until 300 scene == game
wait 30
until 1500 input_locked == 0
click unit 2:SPY:0
click unit 2:SPY:1 shift
click unit 2:SPY:2 shift
click unit 4:E2:4
wait 20
repeat 20
if units(1,TANY) > 0 and selected_type(TANY) == 0 then click unit 1:TANY:0
